('0009344a-adc5-4dd4-9513-ce59c125f5e9', 'gift', 'Can I gift MỨT HẠT SEN?', 'Absolutely! MỨT HẠT SEN makes a wonderful gift of authentic Vietnamese food. LIKEFOOD offers premium gift wrapping and direct delivery to the recipient!', 'mứt hạt sen,mut-hat-sen,gift,present', 'en', 8, 1, '2026-03-12 14:35:33.528', '2026-03-12 14:35:33.518'),
