('19a27960-d88a-4d5a-8811-b10786a839ae', 'usage', 'KIM QUẤT SẤY CAM THẢO for cooking?', 'KIM QUẤT SẤY CAM THẢO is great for authentic Vietnamese cooking! Use in soups, stir-fries, or enjoy as is. Check product page for recipe ideas!', 'kim quất sấy cam thảo,kim-quat-say-cam-thao,cooking,recipe,cook', 'en', 8, 1, '2026-03-12 14:36:56.901', '2026-03-12 14:36:56.886'),
