('1d984d77-b239-4b53-92b6-679ce941a037', 'product', 'Is CÁ ĐÙ CHÁY TỎI spicy?', 'The spice level of CÁ ĐÙ CHÁY TỎI varies. Check the product description for details. Some Vietnamese specialties are spicy, some mild. Ask us for specifics!', 'cá đù cháy tỏi,ca-du-chay-toi,spicy,hot,flavor', 'en', 8, 1, '2026-03-12 14:36:56.637', '2026-03-12 14:36:56.625'),
