('218afd8c-810d-4eef-b211-58da47e00d24', 'shipping', 'TRÀ TÂM SEN delivery options?', 'TRÀ TÂM SEN ships nationwide USA! Standard (5-7 days) or Express (2-3 days). Free shipping on $99+ orders!', 'trà tâm sen,tra-tam-sen,delivery,ship,option', 'en', 7, 1, '2026-03-12 14:40:00.469', '2026-03-12 14:40:00.452'),
