('21d90470-5fb5-418b-912b-19c9f7f052f7', 'product', 'Tell me about BỘT ĐẬU XANH HẠT SEN', 'BỘT ĐẬU XANH HẠT SEN is an authentic Vietnamese specialty product priced at $15.00. Imported directly from Vietnam with quality guarantee. Free shipping on orders $99+!', 'bột đậu xanh hạt sen,about,bot-dau-xanh-hat-sen', 'en', 9, 1, '2026-03-12 14:33:00.266', '2026-03-12 14:33:00.256'),
