('4433716e-e277-4f83-ada7-c72e50cbb9ee', 'origin', 'Where is CÁ ĐUỐI TẨM ĂN LIỀN from?', 'CÁ ĐUỐI TẨM ĂN LIỀN is sourced directly from trusted producers in Vietnam. LIKEFOOD ensures authentic origin and quality through strict inspection.', 'cá đuối tẩm ăn liền,ca-duoi-tam-an-lien,where,origin,from', 'en', 8, 1, '2026-03-12 14:35:33.247', '2026-03-12 14:35:33.237'),
