('7160926f-9b51-4a96-87e8-70f8419a2175', 'usage', 'How to use CÓC SẤY CHANH MUỐI?', 'CÓC SẤY CHANH MUỐI can be enjoyed in many ways! Follow the instructions on the packaging. Great for cooking traditional Vietnamese dishes or as a snack. Check product page for ideas!', 'cóc sấy chanh muối,coc-say-chanh-muoi,use,how to', 'en', 8, 1, '2026-03-12 14:35:33.319', '2026-03-12 14:35:33.310'),
