('843a45db-2443-405d-9676-4e806d070faf', 'usage', 'Best way to enjoy CHẢ CÁ CHIÊN?', 'CHẢ CÁ CHIÊN is best enjoyed fresh! Follow packaging instructions. Great with rice, as a snack, or in traditional Vietnamese recipes!', 'chả cá chiên,cha-ca-chien,enjoy,eat,best way', 'en', 7, 1, '2026-03-12 14:40:00.244', '2026-03-12 14:40:00.230'),
