('89c631c7-7f5d-4847-b0d6-af806fb488f9', 'product', 'Is KHÔ GÀ LÁ CHANH spicy?', 'The spice level of KHÔ GÀ LÁ CHANH varies. Check the product description for details. Some Vietnamese specialties are spicy, some mild. Ask us for specifics!', 'khô gà lá chanh,kho-ga-la-chanh,spicy,hot,flavor', 'en', 8, 1, '2026-03-12 14:36:56.901', '2026-03-12 14:36:56.886'),
