('b10860ae-bde3-458b-871f-fb5f17bcc8b9', 'usage', 'How to use TRÀ ỔI GIẢM CÂN?', 'TRÀ ỔI GIẢM CÂN can be enjoyed in many ways! Follow the instructions on the packaging. Great for cooking traditional Vietnamese dishes or as a snack. Check product page for ideas!', 'trà ổi giảm cân,tra-oi-giam-can,use,how to', 'en', 8, 1, '2026-03-12 14:35:33.625', '2026-03-12 14:35:33.621'),
