('bb6bdad7-c67a-4e11-8d25-3ff8942383b4', 'usage', 'KHÔ CÁ SẶC for cooking?', 'KHÔ CÁ SẶC is great for authentic Vietnamese cooking! Use in soups, stir-fries, or enjoy as is. Check product page for recipe ideas!', 'khô cá sặc,kho-ca-sac,cooking,recipe,cook', 'en', 8, 1, '2026-03-12 14:36:56.901', '2026-03-12 14:36:56.886'),
('bb6e45ea-e584-420d-9e22-8363a2ab6bc0', 'return', 'Return policy for MẮM CÁ LÓC?', '7-day return policy for MẮM CÁ LÓC. Product must be unopened. Contact support for damaged items - we\'ll refund or replace!', 'mắm cá lóc,mam-ca-loc,return,refund,policy', 'en', 7, 1, '2026-03-12 14:40:00.358', '2026-03-12 14:40:00.348'),
