('c39f8951-094b-4d3b-9939-852a65350c8f', 'usage', 'KHÔ CÁ CHỈ VÀNG for cooking?', 'KHÔ CÁ CHỈ VÀNG is great for authentic Vietnamese cooking! Use in soups, stir-fries, or enjoy as is. Check product page for recipe ideas!', 'khô cá chỉ vàng,kho-ca-chi-vang,cooking,recipe,cook', 'en', 8, 1, '2026-03-12 14:36:56.796', '2026-03-12 14:36:56.784'),
