('e488840f-0bc1-42f0-8311-64c3c2515de9', 'usage', 'How to use KHÔ CÁ ĐÙ?', 'KHÔ CÁ ĐÙ can be enjoyed in many ways! Follow the instructions on the packaging. Great for cooking traditional Vietnamese dishes or as a snack. Check product page for ideas!', 'khô cá đù,kho-ca-du,use,how to', 'en', 8, 1, '2026-03-12 14:35:33.384', '2026-03-12 14:35:33.376'),
